<title>USA: WellPoint names Colby CFO.</title>
<headline>WellPoint names Colby CFO.</headline>
<dateline>WOODLAND HILLS, Calif. 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>WellPoint Health Networks Inc said its named David Colby executive vice president and chief financial officer, effective September 2.</p>
<p>Colby previously served as executive vice president and chief financial officer at American Medical Response Inc.</p>
<p>The position of chief financial officer at WellPoint has been vacant since Yon Jorden resigned from that post eight months ago.</p>
